0..54 Comment "/// This source states dependent maps from the circle."
55..58 Comment "///"
59..117 Comment "/// Each case at the point owes transport around the loop."
118..175 Comment "/// A loop arm supplies the path that transport requires."
176..254 Comment "/// This is the circle\'s dependent elimination in the HoTT book\'s Lemma 6.2.5:"
255..307 Comment "/// an answer at the point and a path over the loop."
